Single Level:- 
There will be single parent and child. Parent properties inherits to child.
Ex: - Father and son 
class Father:
    def job(self):
        print("I can do job") 

class Son(Father):
    def play(self): 
        print("I can play cricket") 
        
ob = Son() 
ob.job()  
---------------------------------------------------
Multiple :- 
EXAMPLE :- Father , Mother , Son 
class Father:
    def job(self):
        print("I can do job")

class Mother:
    def cook(self):
        print("I can cook") 
      
class Son(Father,Mother):
    def play(self):
        print("I can play cricket") 

ob = Son()
ob.job()
ob.cook()
ob.play() 
--------------------------------------------------------
Multilevel:-
EXAMPLE :- grandfather , father ,son 
class GrandFather:
    def farm(self):
        print("I can do farm") 

class Father(GrandFather): 
    def job(self):
        print("I can do job") 

class Son(Father):
    def play(self): 
        print("I can play cricket") 
        
ob = Son() 
ob.job()  
ob.play()
ob.farm() 

